					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-9386273#post-4093669</guid>
				<title>Re: Just my opinion</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-9386273/he-sees-you-when-you-re-sleeping-he-knows-when-you-re-awake#post-4093669</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 20 Dec 2018 11:58:06 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Doctor Cimmerian</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1414765</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I feel almost like that misses the point. At that juncture the story has flipped 180 from being a fun Christmas story to a horrible situation. Keeping the rhyme would've screwed with the emotion I'm trying to impart for the sake of fun wordplay, which is why I chose smile over grin when I was writing it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
